Package: financialAccountingEngine
Title: Financial Instruments Accounting Reference Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dimitrios", "Geromichalos",
           email = "riskdatascience@web.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("RiskDataScience GmbH", role = "cph"))
Author: Dimitrios Geromichalos [aut, cre],
    RiskDataScience GmbH [cph]
Maintainer: Dimitrios Geromichalos <riskdatascience@web.de>
Description: Native, granular calculations for financial-instrument accounting,
    including classification, measurement, effective interest, impairment,
    scenario-weighted expected credit losses, modifications, derecognition,
    hedge accounting, journals, disclosures, model backtesting,
    reconciliation, controls, and audit lineage. Provides explicit policy
    inputs and reproducible synthetic reference profiles. It is an independent
    reference implementation and does not constitute audited accounting
    software or authoritative accounting advice.
